{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a2/6qkicqhrjglgzppnoyb0dr1k2p0b592.mp3","text":"那个......我两个小时前，就已经......待在这里了......","alt":"voice_cn/char_215_mantic/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ac/lvlfdvclwg77ilogcn0w0ive1fda6c7.mp3","text":"对不起，我确实很没有存在感......但这个，并不是我能力的原因呀......","alt":"voice_cn/char_215_mantic/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/23/cexz4w82ebquyqw8yy40ws5u2t70sup.mp3","text":"我的能力，实际上是......进入特定的环境后，让别人，意识不到我的存在......","alt":"voice_cn/char_215_mantic/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/ff/fan6xr5fagd4n45dm77fcmaahmnpypm.mp3","text":"我......一直交不到朋友。一个没法被注意到的朋友，谁会想要呢......","alt":"voice_cn/char_215_mantic/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:3/38/kdfwx44ft7egck2cm1xfof11w9r888y.mp3","text":"尾巴......不战斗的时候，会卷起来......所以，请别那么害怕......","alt":"voice_cn/char_215_mantic/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9b/qidh6gyao0tpbkibcumhd75mb9ke4mn.mp3","text":"博士，让我去做，那些危险的任务吧。毕竟，我的能力......非常合适......","alt":"voice_cn/char_215_mantic/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:5/56/jdqf233iirjryy10u2cf0ecj6sowta2.mp3","text":"放在胸前的，这些身份牌，是我捡到的。把人们存在过的痕迹，收集起来，我很喜欢......","alt":"voice_cn/char_215_mantic/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7d/mijqv4fp4sstb1gcylzpm8la0e0ij7a.mp3","text":"那个叫“夜魔”的人，请别让她，靠近我......！那个，她，很危险......我的能力，对她不管用，为什么......","alt":"voice_cn/char_215_mantic/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/71/42dmsnzyt97cmcjjkugs35nnnwkytiw.mp3","text":"我......其实，想要把病治好的。但是，如果，真的治好了，是不是，会失去现在的能力......那样的我，还有价值吗......？","alt":"voice_cn/char_215_mantic/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:2/22/k7d14gvi4kd2dfr0f5do32vpf7fy4bp.mp3","text":"......被博士丢在一边不管了......这种感觉，我，好讨厌......","alt":"voice_cn/char_215_mantic/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2d/3uqffnkzfeat0rrz3jxa58lw1z3ae7d.mp3","text":"我是狮蝎，能力是，悄无声息地夺走别人的生命......请别害怕，这次的目标，不是你......","alt":"voice_cn/char_215_mantic/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:2/25/2t36qsw4m6zzthglxw0zuh29mzuuqv4.mp3","text":"嗯，谢谢。还有，请多关照......","alt":"voice_cn/char_215_mantic/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a6/jz0kdbx824l15qx56c7k78eb5csmbjh.mp3","text":"晋升，我，我终于等到了......我一直以为......是因为我的表现，不够好，所以您一直没有提拔我......","alt":"voice_cn/char_215_mantic/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a4/8q0s69sr80qznou9owm7kyhrctcxg1d.mp3","text":"我帮上您的忙了，对吧......？没有去处的我，这里，这个罗德岛......就是我的家。今后也请和我，一起守护这里......！","alt":"voice_cn/char_215_mantic/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:c/ce/guj5z0s2w0drlzz6hrn0k48m4el75z3.mp3","text":"我知道了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_215_mantic/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1d/bhznou9mqfcq2yqe2qo3049gp2loogo.mp3","text":"我这样的队长，会被大家讨厌的......","alt":"voice_cn/char_215_mantic/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d8/52mq1xghppjz5lqf1c26xoh1bsrjlp9.mp3","text":"别把我丢下......","alt":"voice_cn/char_215_mantic/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0d/j59o2l7d987kfpegka1nte1knf207zg.mp3","text":"请依据我的能力，指定战术吧......就算是比较阴暗的，也没关系......","alt":"voice_cn/char_215_mantic/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:3/39/b6488x6f78izo0imiw8e2jwe1stma12.mp3","text":"准备好了......","alt":"voice_cn/char_215_mantic/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c9/nc4h4s08okm017mn6ze8nyu5ip7dfqz.mp3","text":"我在这里......","alt":"voice_cn/char_215_mantic/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:7/76/577w4jfqhf32wnkw8hahwju85pewjm4.mp3","text":"潜伏，开始......","alt":"voice_cn/char_215_mantic/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d9/e5t065j5jdjp7sv90upzwm7yuv6wisi.mp3","text":"伏击，准备......","alt":"voice_cn/char_215_mantic/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:6/61/6jqwjgsvvk835vhozzf848lbquw7gxg.mp3","text":"很痛苦吧......","alt":"voice_cn/char_215_mantic/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b5/b5b31bu6n99bizrun7nhcnt1d4p9o2d.mp3","text":"别过来......","alt":"voice_cn/char_215_mantic/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/dc/tby9kwexs5wo4qrmh09jf4q53qcebk9.mp3","text":"我也，讨厌，这样做......","alt":"voice_cn/char_215_mantic/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b0/8asoidkjj8xiaasmlf2elmoy6mh54cj.mp3","text":"永别了......","alt":"voice_cn/char_215_mantic/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2f/jr0txu9p3pfsnzbge6coojha0boixiv.mp3","text":"就算，是这样可怕的战场，您的判断力、集中力，一点都没有受到影响。博士，好帅气......","alt":"voice_cn/char_215_mantic/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d1/6mz2oeh3yx4tlyqx6wa26w2scntntlq.mp3","text":"为了胜利，我们什么都得做，只是......","alt":"voice_cn/char_215_mantic/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:d/dd/114dqgo8c7pmwabucb2ow2ha1w4efyh.mp3","text":"要抓住，逃走的人的话，请交给我......","alt":"voice_cn/char_215_mantic/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ed/ec0516rm6o5gxulojb8738dx89qlrku.mp3","text":"对不起......都是我没做好......","alt":"voice_cn/char_215_mantic/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8e/5v5cpv5opt707nlrh5hfer1ep0ao0yf.mp3","text":"我去角落里，坐着......","alt":"voice_cn/char_215_mantic/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:6/62/gyfp0b96vf5f8thb5vuno6blalt16wf.mp3","text":"欸欸欸？？？","alt":"voice_cn/char_215_mantic/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fa/t40bv4ld930vr52l2ldfzd6jmv4hvyu.mp3","text":"那个，您经常关注着我，虽然这是您的职责，我也......非常开心......","alt":"voice_cn/char_215_mantic/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:8/88/j51q77op3epwxscydh4kx151r3xwtvx.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_215_mantic/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4c/g93oz29nfn95pfoo0jxysfrytasrfi3.mp3","text":"新年快乐......过去一年，注意到我的人，变多了......我有点害怕，但是，温柔的人，也很多......所以，我会努力去适应的......","alt":"voice_cn/char_215_mantic/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:5/58/iadcxc7ah04j35g3jnuht6ifglm35rq.mp3","text":"博士......你好......","alt":"voice_cn/char_215_mantic/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1c/6pttjl1iqa4wc46hw0tkx5t5tksfhmh.mp3","text":"那个......我两个小时前，就已经......待在这里了......","alt":"voice/char_215_mantic/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ea/kktygdh1bu0yzpd7z342q2egs6usmkg.mp3","text":"对不起，我确实很没有存在感......但这个，并不是我能力的原因呀......","alt":"voice/char_215_mantic/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a7/q24mvekymrnod5qtds3fugamekt3qa4.mp3","text":"我的能力，实际上是......进入特定的环境后，让别人，意识不到我的存在......","alt":"voice/char_215_mantic/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a7/kjk3ihcr2hodfvjk2ow2wfg4c3xyvcy.mp3","text":"我......一直交不到朋友。一个没法被注意到的朋友，谁会想要呢......","alt":"voice/char_215_mantic/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b3/bovrmlkyozv9o59w3x94y84xsaoz4mt.mp3","text":"尾巴......不战斗的时候，会卷起来......所以，请别那么害怕......","alt":"voice/char_215_mantic/c